```

## 5. Scope / non-goals

- Translate mode only; passthrough `data: [DONE]` emission (#142 OpenClaw workaround) is untouched.
- Don't reuse `state.finishReasonSent`.
- Don't infer `tool_use` for synthesized stops.
- No `message_start` ⇒ no terminal synthesized.
